oder](https://github.com/k4ran909/Fluxnat-coder)**\n\n---\n\n### Next Step:\nYou can open **`Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb`** in Google Colab and run all cells. The retrained model will correctly classify CWE-502, CWE-79, CWE-918, CWE-120, and CWE-798 instead of defaulting to CWE-22.","thinking":"Generated a dataset generation script focusing on misclassified CWEs. Developed 24 examples using Chain-of-Thought for multiple languages and vulnerabilities. Included CWE-502 (Insecure Deserialization) and CWE-79 (Cross-Site Scripting) as part of the coverage.\n\n\n"}
